      {
        "id": 17292,
        "title": "Che cosa sono le librerie e i CDN?",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146561,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un gioco ha sistemi come salute, punteggio e nemici. Puoi anche aggiungere nuove funzionalità come potenziamenti e livelli.</p><p>Esistono librerie anche in JavaScript! Possiamo prendere in prestito codice scritto da altri e anche contribuire con il nostro codice, affinché altri possano usarlo.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146562,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Altri programmatori potrebbero pensare che il codice che scrivono possa essere utile agli altri. Le librerie JavaScript contengono codice destinato all'uso pubblico.</p><p>Per essere utili, queste librerie dovrebbero essere accessibili.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146563,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le librerie sono solitamente archiviate in una <code>Content Delivery Network (CDN)</code>. Una <code>CDN</code> è una rete che distribuisce rapidamente i contenuti web fornendoli da un server vicino.</p><p>Possiamo usare una libreria <code>CDN</code> includendola nell'attributo <code>src</code> del tag <code>script</code> nel nostro file HTML.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"64\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My game is loading...\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/gamekit.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>src</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146564,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'attributo <code>src</code> contiene il <code>CDN</code> seguito da <code>/</code> e dal nome della libreria. Identifica il <code>CDN</code> e la libreria dal codice qui sotto.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/spritefx.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>https://mimo.org</code> è il <code>CDN</code> e <code>spritefx.js</code> è la libreria</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://mimo.org</code> è la libreria e <code>spritefx.js</code> è il <code>CDN</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>https://mimo.org</code> è il <code>CDN</code> e <code>spritefx.js</code> è la libreria.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146565,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La libreria <code>spritefx.js</code> fa oscillare lo sprite dell'elemento con ID <code>\"player\"</code>. In questo esempio, <code>teach.getmimo.com</code> è il nostro <code>CDN</code>.</p><p>Aggiungi un tag <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> e imposta il valore corretto per l'attributo <code>src</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"110\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"145\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"style\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"#player\" class=\"selector-id\" /><text value=\" { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"font-size\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"40px\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   } \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"style\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/spritefx.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"@\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>script</code>, seguito da <code>src</code> e infine <code>\"https://mimo.org/spritefx.js\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146566,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In che modo le librerie ci aiutano a risparmiare tempo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Possiamo usare una soluzione già scritta da altri programmatori</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un game designer correggerà il nostro codice per noi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Possiamo usare una soluzione già scritta da altri programmatori.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146567,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa significa <code>CDN</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Content Delivery Network</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Central Data Notebook</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Content Delivery Network</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146568,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale <strong>libreria</strong> viene importata nel codice qui sotto?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/collisions.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>collisions.js</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>mimo.org</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>collisions.js</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146569,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Importa la libreria <code>collisions.js</code>. Il <code>CDN</code> che memorizza la libreria è <code>https://teach.getmimo.com</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"117\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My game uses libraries\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/collisions.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>https</code>, seguito da <code>:</code> e poi <code>//mimo.org/</code>, <code>collisions.js\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17293,
        "title": "Librerie JS",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146570,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con le librerie, possiamo usare la soluzione che qualcun altro ha codificato per risolvere un problema che stiamo affrontando.</p><p>Ogni libreria è diversa. Quando usiamo una libreria, dobbiamo consultare la documentazione per sapere come usare le funzioni che fornisce.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146571,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In base alla documentazione qui sotto, quale funzione dovremmo usare per aggiungere punti al punteggio del giocatore?</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   table,&#xA;   td {&#xA;    border: solid 1px black;&#xA;    border-collapse: collapse;&#xA;    padding: 5px;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Score Library&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Open-sourced library for basic score calculations in games.&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;table&gt;&#xA;   &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;addPoints(score, points)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;Function to add points to the current score&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;   &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;removePoints(score, points)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;Function to remove points from the current score&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;   &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;resetScore()&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;Function to reset the score to 0&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;   &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;formatScore(score)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;Function to format the score for the UI&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/table&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Version 3.1.0&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Added input handling to accept String values as parameter&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>addPoints(score, points)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>removePoints(score, points)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>addLives(lives)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>addPoints(score, points)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146572,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per usare il codice delle librerie, dobbiamo trovare la funzione nella documentazione e usarla dove ci serve.</p><p>Mostra il risultato dell'aggiunta di <code>50</code> punti a un punteggio di <code>0</code> usando la funzione che abbiamo trovato nella libreria <code>score.js</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreText = \" /><text value=\"document\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".querySelector(\" /><text value=\"&quot;#score&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scoreText.innerHTML = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + score.addPoints(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;score&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/score.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;script.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>score</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>addPoints</code>, <code>(0, 50)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146573,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare moltissime librerie. Qui, <code>state.js</code> ci permette di formattare e visualizzare lo stato di gioco usando JavaScript.</p><p>Quale parte del codice pensi che fornisca la libreria <code>state.js</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" stateLabel = state(\" /><text value=\"&quot;gameover&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\").format(\" /><text value=\"&quot;TITLE&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ui = \" /><text value=\"document\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".getElementById(\" /><text value=\"&quot;state&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ui.innerHTML = stateLabel;\" /></content></code><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Current Game State\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;state&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/state.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;script.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>format(\"TITLE\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>ui</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>format(\"TITLE\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146574,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un altro vantaggio delle librerie è che i problemi vengono solitamente risolti rapidamente dai loro utenti. Prova ad aggiungere punti con una <code>String</code>.</p><p>Potremmo pensare che non funzionerà. Tuttavia, funziona ancora perché qualcun altro ha già pensato a questo caso!</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"109\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreText = \" /><text value=\"document\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".querySelector(\" /><text value=\"&quot;#score&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scoreText.innerHTML = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + score.addPoints(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;50&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;score&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text va